       "text": "Dear Hatsune Miku fans,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "How's everyone enjoying Hatsune Miku Logic Paint S? We are happy to let you know that with the release of \"Version 1.1.4,\" we fixed a couple of known issues.",
